          "id": 1256326322,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "glib doesn't like it if `g_hash_table_foreach` is called on a NULL GHashTable. Either check if it's NULL before each call, or create it in `frame_data_init()` and call `g_hash_table_remove_all()` in `frame_data_reset()`.\n\n`g_hash_table_foreach: assertion 'hash_table != NULL' failed`",
